PROGRAMS THE GENERATOR CALLS, NOT REDISTRIBUTED HERE
===============================================================================

The VIEWER — open a splat scene, measure it, section it, save stills of it
— needs nothing beyond the components above and runs in a browser.

The GENERATOR — video to splat, dense mesh, terrain model — calls the programs
below. None of them is in this repository: each is fetched separately and used
under its own licence. They are named here so that the debt is on record, and
so that nobody packaging a generator release assumes they are covered by this
repository's licence. They are not.

COLMAP — camera poses, and the dense pipeline behind the measurable mesh
    BSD 3-Clause licence.  https://github.com/colmap/colmap

